      "content": "i guess. it just feels so exhausting. like, if the world is just going to keep breaking and destroying everything beautiful, why is there this obligation to just stand here and suffer through it? it feels almost cruel to be forced to watch the wreckage. isn't there a certain kind of peace in just... letting go before the worst of it happens?",
